WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.100
Under a tree at the edge of
a village sits a small stone,

2
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.620
marked with red powder,
flowers and a lamp.

3
00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:11.600
Passers-by stop briefly
to pray, then walk on.

4
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.750
In a mandir, the main
murti sits in a small,

5
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.060
dark inner room, under a tall tower.

6
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.270
Many Hindus believe the
divine is everywhere.

7
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:25.080
So why build a temple, and
why keep a shrine at home?

8
00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:28.040
In this mission, you'll
walk through a Hindu temple,

9
00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.860
from the bell at the
door to the inner shrine.

10
00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:35.480
Then you'll look inside a home shrine,
from the small lamp to the bell.

11
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:39.850
Your mission: find out why Hindus
worship in temples and homes,

12
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.250
if God is everywhere.
